{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011CeJiUSzBjoMsFggRQcv1T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 8 tests pass (4 committed + 4 added).\n\n**Design:**\n- `summarizeAssistants`: filters eligible runs (`status === \"complete\"`, `acceptance_status === \"pass\"`, `comparison_eligible !== false`), validates only those, groups by exact `assistant` string, picks the best run via score → elapsed_ms → run_id tie-break, computes median elapsed time from a numeric sort of all eligible runs per assistant, and returns assistant-sorted summaries without mutating input.\n- `renderComparisonTable`: validates each summary's fields, escapes `|` in `assistant`/`best_run_id`, formats median as seconds with 3 decimals, and returns the empty-state markdown when given `[]`.\n\n**Edge cases covered by added tests:**\n1. Non-array input throws `TypeError`.\n2. Invalid fields on an *ineligible* run are ignored, but the same invalid field on an eligible run throws.\n3. Median calculation for an odd-length group (verifies true median, not average-of-two).\n4. `renderComparisonTable` throws `TypeError` when `run_count` is not a positive integer.\n\n**Verification:** `node --test comparison-summary.test.mjs student-tests.mjs` → 8/8 passing, 0 failures."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":516,"cache_read_input_tokens":26597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":516},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a663fbdb-6f03-43a8-82ce-69954a141642","uuid":"7ead4f98-f78a-463f-a6e9-cd853e6f9999","timestamp":"2026-08-23T00:15:00.095Z","request_id":"req_011CeJiUSEHuxhAsLWa5j88P"}
